  "items": [
    {
      "source": "The parser locates a <a href=\"BeanDefinitionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeanDefinitionParser</code></a> from the associated\n<a href=\"NamespaceHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>NamespaceHandler</code></a> for the namespace in which the custom tag resides.",
      "translation": "解析器从关联的 <a href=\"NamespaceHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>NamespaceHandler</code></a> 中定位自定义标签所在命名空间的 <a href=\"BeanDefinitionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeanDefinitionParser</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations are free to turn the metadata in the custom tag into as many\n<a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinitions</code></a> as required.",
      "translation": "实现可以随意将自定义标签中的元数据转换为所需的任意数量的 <a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinitions</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations must return the primary <a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> that results\nfrom the parse if they will ever be used in a nested fashion (for example as\nan inner tag in a <code>&lt;property/&gt;</code> tag). Implementations may return\n<code>null</code> if they will <strong>not</strong> be used in a nested fashion.",
      "translation": "实现必须返回解析后生成的主<a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>，如果它们将在嵌套方式中使用（例如作为<code>&lt;property/&gt;</code>标签中的内部标签）。如果实现不会以嵌套方式使用，则可以返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Parse the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a> and register the resulting\n<a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition(s)</code></a> with the\n<a href=\"ParserContext.html#getRegistry()\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>\nembedded in the supplied <a href=\"ParserContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>ParserContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析指定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>，并将生成的\n<a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition(s)</code></a> 注册到\n<a href=\"ParserContext.html#getRegistry()\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>\n中，该 <a href=\"ParserContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>ParserContext</code></a> 已嵌入其中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>element</code> - the element that is to be parsed into one or more <a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinitions</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>element</code> - 要解析为一个或多个<a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinitions</code></a>的元素",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parserContext</code> - the object encapsulating the current state of the parsing process;\nprovides access to a <a href=\"../support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>parserContext</code> - 封装当前解析过程状态的对象；提供对<a href=\"../support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>的访问",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the primary <a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>",
      "translation": "主要 `<a href=\"../config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>`",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Rob Harrop",
      "translation": "Rob Harrop",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
